hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"243","We are Muhammad bin Bashar, we are Yahya bin Saeed, we are Jaafar, who is the son of Muhammad bin Ali bin Hussein bin Ali bin Abi Talib. H Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala’, Sa’id bin Abdul-Rahman Al-Makhzoumi, and Omar bin Hafs Al-Shaybani told us, they said: Sufyan told us, On the authority of Ja`far, on the authority of his father, he said: Jabir ibn Abdullah said to me: Your cousin Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad asked me about washing from ritual impurity, and I said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to wear three hairpieces on his head, and he said: My hair is abundant. I said: The Messenger of God’s hair was more than Your hair and the best.” This is the hadith of Yahya bin Saeed."
